-- hand from the text.

§ `s 2`

`a flag day on Orchard Road` MEANS Appeal WITH
    `is made to the public or a class of the public` IS TRUE
    `is made by visits from house to house` IS FALSE
    `is made by soliciting in streets or public places` IS TRUE
    `asks for money or property legally due from the donor` IS FALSE

`a door-to-door charity appeal` MEANS Appeal WITH
    `is made to the public or a class of the public` IS TRUE
    `is made by visits from house to house` IS TRUE
    `is made by soliciting in streets or public places` IS FALSE
    `asks for money or property legally due from the donor` IS FALSE

`selling cookies door to door for a cause` MEANS Appeal WITH
    `is made to the public or a class of the public` IS TRUE
    `is made by visits from house to house` IS TRUE
    `is made by soliciting in streets or public places` IS FALSE
    `asks for money or property legally due from the donor` IS FALSE

`an appeal from shop to shop` MEANS Appeal WITH
    `is made to the public or a class of the public` IS TRUE
    `is made by visits from house to house` IS TRUE
    `is made by soliciting in streets or public places` IS FALSE
    `asks for money or property legally due from the donor` IS FALSE

`an online crowdfunding appeal` MEANS Appeal WITH
    `is made to the public or a class of the public` IS TRUE
    `is made by visits from house to house` IS FALSE
    `is made by soliciting in streets or public places` IS FALSE
    `asks for money or property legally due from the donor` IS FALSE

`a debt collector calling at homes` MEANS Appeal WITH
    `is made to the public or a class of the public` IS TRUE
    `is made by visits from house to house` IS TRUE
    `is made by soliciting in streets or public places` IS FALSE
    `asks for money or property legally due from the donor` IS TRUE

`a town council collecting conservancy charges door to door` MEANS Appeal WITH
    `is made to the public or a class of the public` IS TRUE
    `is made by visits from house to house` IS TRUE
    `is made by soliciting in streets or public places` IS FALSE
    `asks for money or property legally due from the donor` IS TRUE

#ASSERT `the appeal is a collection` `a flag day on Orchard Road`
