§ `s 4`

`a clean application` MEANS Grounds WITH
    `(a) too little of the proceeds would reach the purpose` IS FALSE
    `(b) excessive remuneration out of the proceeds` IS FALSE
    `(c) an offence facilitated or force or threats used` IS FALSE
    `(d) the applicant has a dishonesty conviction` IS FALSE
    `(e) no due diligence over collectors or badges` IS FALSE
    `(f) unlawful society, improper purpose or public interest` IS FALSE
    `(g) false or withheld information` IS FALSE

`an appeal paying its organisers most of the takings` MEANS Grounds WITH
    `(a) too little of the proceeds would reach the purpose` IS TRUE
    `(b) excessive remuneration out of the proceeds` IS TRUE
    `(c) an offence facilitated or force or threats used` IS FALSE
